{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55766","headline":"师亲写版牌云 一 · 义存","name":"师亲写版牌云 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妄身临镜照影，影与妄身不殊。\n若欲去影留身，不知身影常虚。\n身影从来不异，不得一有一无。\n若拟憎凡爱圣，生死海里常浮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"义存","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55766.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55766","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}